REGENT OF PESISIR BARAT,

Considering:
that to implement the provisions of number I letter H number 2 and number 6 column 5 appendix of Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government as has been amended several times most recently by Law Number 11 of 2020 concerning Job Creation, it is necessary to stipulate a Regional Regulation concerning Protection of Women and Children from Acts of Violence;

In View of:
1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;

